rProfile:profilePropertyList[].name": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Sun Texture Intensity": {"AzureWeatherProfile:profilePropertyList[].name": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Moon Texture Intensity": {"AzureWeatherProfile:profilePropertyList[].name": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Directional Light Strength": {"AzureWeatherProfile:profilePropertyList[].name": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Static Cloud Scattering": {"AzureWeatherProfile:profilePropertyList[].name": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Static Cloud Color": {"AzureWeatherProfile:profilePropertyList[].name": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Temperature": {"AzureWeatherProfile:profilePropertyList[].name": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/City Gates/Explorers note about the new tunnel.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Explorer's note about the new tunnel": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Hey,\n\nI told Hans about the new tunnel I managed to clear open. We're gearing up and planning to check it out together today.\n\nI warned him that the entrance is a bit tight, and several caves have collapsed in a short time, but there's something about this one that feels different. Hans sensed it too, and he wants to check it out as soon as possible.\n\nMaybe this is finally the route to the other side of the gate we've been searching for all this time? If you're up for it, join us.\n\nStay sharp.": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/City Gates/Explorers note about the pipe.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Explorer's note about the pipe": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "There's some noise coming from the area where the pipe goes. It's like an alarm or something.\n\nI tried squeezing through to get a closer look, but no luck. The cave narrows to a point where I would probably just get stuck. I'm not really keen on getting stuck underground like the guy whose body we found recently. It's like my worst nightmare.\n\nHanss asked me to clear the tunnel that leads to the gate. I warned him that the tunnels have been collapsing more frequently recently. I'm probably going to go with him next time he comes here.": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Ambience": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Drips": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Rocks": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Light": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}, "Wood": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets34.assets"]}}}